00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.830
The habits spread, and now the whole lizard population,

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:25.750
uniquely in the Mediterranean, have become Arum fruit eaters.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.980
They do take a bit of swallowing, but seeds passing through a lizard's gut

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:36.980
not only survive, but germinate even more easily.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.870
As a result, the arums, which were rather scarce here 20 years ago,

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.570
have suddenly become abundant all over the island.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.790
A cold, windswept island off the coast of South Africa

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:12.380
is not the first place you'd go to if you were looking for reptiles.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:17.260
But here on Dassin Island, among penguins and seagulls,

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:20.390
there's one of the greatest concentration of tortoises

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.960
to be found anywhere on Earth.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.880
There are about 5,000 of them on this one tiny island.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:39.660
