for comfort. Tortoises have to head for shade.

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:45.560
In the late afternoon, it gets cooler, and the tortoises venture out again.

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.800
For them, this is the best time.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:52.360
